        <div class="font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-accent mb-2">08 &mdash; Strategy</div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-[clamp(24px,3.5vw,32px)] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink mb-2">Multi-niche vs specialist strategy</h2>
        <div class="tldr">
          <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 space-y-1">
