            <li class="text-[14px] text-ink-2 before:content-['—_'] before:text-accent before:font-semibold">Multi-niche works if niches are adjacent (e.g., fitness + supplements)</li>
            <li class="text-[14px] text-ink-2 before:content-['—_'] before:text-accent before:font-semibold">Best approach: 1 primary niche + 1 adjacent secondary niche</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">Should you focus on one niche or spread across several? The data favors specialists, but the optimal strategy is nuanced.</p>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border bg-card mb-6">
          <table class="w-full border-collapse text-[14px]">
            <thead class="bg-bg">
              <tr>
                <th class="font-display font-semibold text-[13px] px-4 py-3 text-left border-b border-border">Factor</th>
                <th class="font-display font-semibold text-[13px] px-4 py-3 text-left border-b border-border">Specialist</th>
                <th class="font-display font-semibold text-[13px] px-4 py-3 text-left border-b border-border">Multi-niche</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">Average pay per video</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">40&ndash;60% higher</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Baseline</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">Deal flow volume</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Narrower, but higher close rate</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Wider funnel, lower close rate</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">Retainer likelihood</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">High &mdash; brands prefer niche experts</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Lower &mdash; seen as interchangeable</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">Portfolio strength</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Deep, focused, credible</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Broad, less coherent</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-ink">Risk profile</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-ink-2">Higher &mdash; niche could contract</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-ink-2">Lower &mdash; diversified income</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
