        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4"><strong>Our recommendation:</strong> Pick one primary niche and one adjacent secondary niche. For example: fitness (primary) + health supplements (secondary). Or tech/SaaS (primary) + education (secondary). The adjacency means your skills transfer naturally and brands in both niches see you as credible. Keep separate portfolio pages for each niche to maintain the specialist positioning.</p>
